@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About | CodeWithABKhan</PageTitle>

<section class="section-shell page-intro">
    <p class="section-kicker">About this portfolio</p>
    <h1>A proof-led rebuild</h1>
    <p>
        The old version of this site mixed real public work with stale wording, duplicated entries, and outdated profile links.
        This rebuild keeps the public portfolio grounded in what can be verified today and separates future direction from shipped proof.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="section-shell prose-grid">
    <article class="service-card">
        <p class="card-label">Verified facts</p>
        <h2>What the public trail supports</h2>
        <p>
            A durable .NET and Blazor foundation, public portfolio iterations, MAUI and business-system repositories, and recent
            AI-adjacent build experiments that show current technical direction.
        </p>
    </article>
    <article class="service-card">
        <p class="card-label">Deliberate restraint</p>
        <h2>What this site will not claim</h2>
        <p>
            No fake testimonials. No client logos. No invented metrics. No claims about ROI, automation depth, or production agent systems
            unless public proof exists to back them up.
        </p>
    </article>
</section>
